# Afagh weekly UEMS sync - configuration template# Copy this file to %USERPROFILE%\.afagh\uems-sync.env and fill in the values.# NEVER commit the filled file. Lines starting with # are ignored.## To schedule the run, execute register-weekly-uems-sync-task.bat YOURSELF# (the agent cannot run schtasks.exe - it is on the host Program Blacklist).# The education step was 6901s before the batch rewrite; it is now ~70s on# unchanged weekly data (bulk unnest inserts + in-memory key sets).# ---- Source: legacy UEMS / SQL Server ----UEMS_SERVER=127.0.0.1,62133UEMS_DB=uems# 1 = Windows integrated auth (sqlcmd -E). 0 = SQL user/password below.UEMS_TRUSTED=1# UEMS_USER=sa# UEMS_PASS=# ---- Target: Afagh Postgres ----# Postgres is NOT exposed on the server host. The launcher opens an SSH# tunnel from Windows to the Docker-internal PG address and points the# orchestrator at the local end of that tunnel.TARGET_HOST=127.0.0.1TARGET_PORT=15432TARGET_DB=afagh_dbTARGET_USER=afagh# ---- SSH tunnel (optional, set to 1 to enable) ----UEMS_SYNC_SSH_TUNNEL=1SSH_HOST=root@100.70.187.120SSH_KEY=C:\Users\Farzi\.ssh\afagh_ed25519PG_INTERNAL_HOST=172.20.0.5TUNNEL_LOCAL_PORT=15432# ---- Secret handling ----# 1 = fetch POSTGRES_PASSWORD from the server .env over SSH at run time.#     Recommended: no database password is stored on the Windows machine.# 0 = put AFAGH_TARGET_PASSWORD=<password> in this file instead.UEMS_SYNC_FETCH_DB_PASSWORD=1# AFAGH_TARGET_PASSWORD=# ---- Behaviour ----UNI=1# FIN_DIR is NO LONGER the input of the weekly run. Each run extracts fresh# finance TSVs (TermAms/StdPays/paytype/TermPrice/_t + _manifest.json) from# UEMS into <work-dir>\fin_export. FIN_DIR is only:#   * the input when UEMS_SYNC_SKIP_EXTRACT=1 or UEMS_SYNC_FIN_STATIC=1#   * the MIRROR target when UEMS_SYNC_FIN_REFRESH=1 (old files are backed up#     to FIN_DIR.bak-<stamp> before being replaced)FIN_DIR=D:\backups\fin_export# 1 = also refresh the static FIN_DIR from this run's fresh extraction.UEMS_SYNC_FIN_REFRESH=0# 1 = force the migration to read the static FIN_DIR instead of fresh TSVs.UEMS_SYNC_FIN_STATIC=0# 1 = propagate source-side corrections (amount / description) to rows that#     were already imported into student_ledger. Without this, the migration#     is INSERT-only and a corrected payment in UEMS never reaches Afagh.#     A JSONL backup of every affected row is written to <work-dir>; restore#     with: node scripts/migrate-legacy-finance.mjs --restore <file.jsonl>#     Only amount and description change; all identity/provenance columns and#     rows belonging to other universities are left untouched.UEMS_SYNC_FIN_UPSERT=0# ---- Student master data (status / raw SAMA code) ----# Each run extracts MAININFO_students.tsv + People_identity.tsv + _manifest.json# from UEMS into <work-dir>\students_export. STUDENTS_DIR is only:#   * the input when UEMS_SYNC_SKIP_EXTRACT=1 or UEMS_SYNC_STUDENTS_STATIC=1#   * the MIRROR target when UEMS_SYNC_STUDENTS_REFRESH=1STUDENTS_DIR=D:\backups\students_exportUEMS_SYNC_STUDENTS_REFRESH=0UEMS_SYNC_STUDENTS_STATIC=0# 0 = report the gap only (default, no DB writes).# 1 = actually update students.status + students.samaStatusCode for students#     that already exist. Only those two columns change; no student is created#     or deleted. A JSONL backup of affected rows is written to <work-dir>;#     restore with: node scripts/migrate-legacy-students.mjs --restore <file>UEMS_SYNC_STUDENTS_APPLY=0MASTER_DIR=D:////backups////master_export
# Master data (LT66 majors + DONBIN professors): fresh extraction every run;
# MASTER_DIR is only the offline/mirror folder. MASTER_APPLY=1 inserts new
# majors/professors/students (JSONL backup written; restore via import-new-master.mjs --restore).
UEMS_SYNC_MASTER_REFRESH=0
UEMS_SYNC_MASTER_STATIC=0
UEMS_SYNC_MASTER_APPLY=0
# 1 = print the commands and exit without writing anything. Set 0 for a real run.UEMS_SYNC_PLAN=1# 1 = reuse existing TSVs instead of extracting from UEMS.UEMS_SYNC_SKIP_EXTRACT=0# Optional: folder holding uems_rates/ and uems_edu/ when skip-extract=1.# UEMS_SYNC_WORK_DIR=D:\backups\uems_live_20261110